<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89861" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσοφλισκάνω</span></b> , fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-οφλήσω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EN</u>
					1124b11
				</span></i>
			: <i><span class="en">
				2
			</span></i>
			aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ῶφλον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					35.46
				</span></i>
			, etc.; <i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>
			aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσοφλῆσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alciphr.
					3.26
				</span></i>
			:—<i>owe besides</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεντακοσίας δραχμάς, ἃς προσῶφλεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					58.19
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i>incur a debt</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
			</span></i> l.c. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> as
			law-term, <i>lose one's suit and incur a penalty besides</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τὰ ἐπιτίμια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					35.46
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἐπωβελίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					45.6
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				1.163
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χιλίας</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δραχμάς</span>) <i><span class="en">
				D.
				23.80
			</span></i>: abs., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρατηγήσας προσῶφλε</span>
			<i>was fined</i> in his office of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρατηγός</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				204.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> generally,
				<i>incur besides</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. αἰσχύνην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					5.5
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				8.12
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνελευθερίαν τῇ κακοηθείᾳ
			π</span>. <i>get a character for</i> meanness <i>in addition
				to . . </i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.856c
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				43c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γέλωτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alciphr.
				</span></i>
			 l.c.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τὸν λεγόμενον ἰχθύων βίον</span>
			<i>deserve to be said</i> to live like fish, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				15.20.3
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
